# Keep the build context free of anything the image should not depend on.
#
# node_modules is excluded so the image is built only from `npm ci` output,
# never from whatever is installed on the machine running the build. A local
# build and a build from a clean checkout then resolve the same dependencies.
**/node_modules

# Build output — regenerated inside the image.
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo

# Never ship secrets or local state into a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.claude
.git
.github

# Noise.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.vscode
**/.idea
